<h3>TC-CRT-07: Cart Preservation Through Authentication</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Role:</strong> Customer A</li>
<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Sign out of all accounts. Add a book to cart as guest at <code>/cart</code>.</li>
<li><strong>Starting Page:</strong> <code>http://localhost:3000/cart</code></li>
<li><strong>Numbered Actions:</strong><ol>
<li>On <code>/cart</code>, verify the book is present with plan <strong>&quot;Read Online (₹49)&quot;</strong>.</li>
