<h3>TC-RDR-08: Offline / Network Drop Progress-Save Recovery</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Role:</strong> Customer A</li>
<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> In reader at <code>/read/[bookSlug]/[chapterId]</code>.</li>
