<li>Open DevTools (<code>F12</code>) $\rightarrow$ Network tab $\rightarrow$ Set Throttling to <strong>&quot;Offline&quot;</strong>.</li>
<li>Scroll the chapter text up and down.</li>
<li>Wait 2 seconds and observe the saving status indicator in the top header.</li>
<li>Turn Network back to <strong>&quot;No throttling&quot;</strong> (Online).</li>
<li>In the header, click the red button: <strong>&quot;Save failed (Retry)&quot;</strong>.</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li><strong>Expected Results:</strong><ul>
<li>While offline, saving fails gracefully and displays a red <strong>&quot;Save failed (Retry)&quot;</strong> button.</li>
<li>Reading is not interrupted and no crash occurs.</li>
<li>When connection is restored, clicking &quot;Save failed (Retry)&quot; re-triggers <code>persistProgress()</code> and updates status to <code>Saved</code>.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>Evidence to Record:</strong> Screenshot of &quot;Save failed (Retry)&quot; indicator.</li>
<li><strong>Actual Result:</strong> Pending execution.</li>
