<h3>TC-ADM-13: Optimistic Concurrency Conflict Detection on Stale Pricing Edits</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Role:</strong> Administrator</li>
<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Published book pricing tab open.</li>
<li><strong>Starting Page:</strong> <code>/admin/e-books/[bookId]/edit?tab=pricing</code></li>
