<h2>12. Test Suite I: External Dependencies and Technical Checks</h2>
<p>These checks address operational launch gates, feature flags, and environment capabilities.</p>
<hr>
<h3>TC-TECH-01: Transactional Email Receipts &amp; Refund Notifications</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Role:</strong> Developer / QA Engineer</li>
<li><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Environment inspection.</li>
<li><strong>Execution:</strong><ol>
<li>Check <code>frontend/.env.local</code> for <code>RESEND_API_KEY</code> or <code>SMTP_HOST</code>.</li>
<li>Observe: Credentials are not yet provisioned (<code>RESEND_API_KEY</code> is empty).</li>
<li>Review <code>test_email_acceptance.ts</code> test results: The outbox queue pattern operates asynchronously without blocking payments, but emails cannot be delivered to physical inboxes until operational DNS (SPF, DKIM, DMARC) and provider keys are provisioned.</li>
</ol>
</li>
<li><strong>Expected Results:</strong><ul>
<li>Order verification succeeds and creates outbox records cleanly.</li>
<li>Email transport remains blocked pending domain credentials.</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>Status:</strong> <strong>BLOCKED</strong> (Operational dependency: Resend / SMTP credentials and DNS records).</li>
<li><strong>Issue Reference:</strong> Launch Blocker Gate 2 (<code>docs/ebooks/audit-remediation-report.md</code>).</li>
</ul>
